 urces\n→\n	 \n			Attention Trading Partners: Council for Affordable Qual
 ity Healthcare (CAQH) Real Time Service\nAttention Trading Partners: Counc
 il for Affordable Quality Healthcare (CAQH) Real Time Service\nOct 14\, 20
 26\nAs\nshared previously\n\, we have launched the new MaineCare Partner P
 ortal\, which replaces the previous HealthPAS Online Portal.\nTrading Part
 ners can now transmit transactions online through\nCAQH Web Services\n.\nI
 nstead of using your Trading Partner account password and username to perf
 orm CAQH transactions\, there are new procedures to generate an access key
  from your MaineCare Trading Partner account. We have updated connectivity
  and security rules to align with current CAQH standards\, providing enhan
 ced security and a standardized method for exchanging electronic transacti
 ons.\nFor additional information about the new procedures\, refer to the\n
 Companion Guides\nlocated in the\nMaineCare Partner Portal\nunder the Prov
 ider tab > Provider Manuals subtab. You can also refer to the training mat
 erials associated with the following courses in the\nMMIS Learning Center\
 n:\nME - TPT - Migrated Trading Partner - Account Login and Account Mainte
 nance\nME - TPT - Trading Partner Registration and Account Maintenance\nFo
 r questions\, please contact Provider Services at\n1-866-690-5585\n.\nhttp
